{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":48.459999084472656,"text":"The loggia was built in the 1620s, and it was not a church, a palace, or a fortress. It was a club. The Venetian nobles of Heracleion gathered here to talk, to strike deals, and to take decisions about the city. It has two stories of arcades, rows of arches resting on columns, and it is built to show wealth without shouting about it. Over time, it fell almost completely into ruin. It was rebuilt piece by piece, using whatever original stones could be found, and that work was named the best restored monument in Europe in 1987. Today, the building is not a museum, it is Heracleion City Hall, and people work inside it every day. A 400-year-old building still doing more or less its original job is rarer than a ruin.","words":[{"word":"The","start":0,"end":0.5199999809265137},{"word":"loggia","start":0.5199999809265137,"end":0.8799999952316284},{"word":"was","start":0.8799999952316284,"end":1.1799999475479126},{"word":"built","start":1.1799999475479126,"end":1.4199999570846558},{"word":"in","start":1.4199999570846558,"end":1.6399999856948853},{"word":"the","start":1.6399999856948853,"end":1.8799999952316284},{"word":"1620s","start":1.8799999952316284,"end":2.799999952316284},{"word":"and","start":3.0799999237060547,"end":3.299999952316284},{"word":"it","start":3.299999952316284,"end":3.4200000762939453},{"word":"was","start":3.4200000762939453,"end":3.559999942779541},{"word":"not","start":3.559999942779541,"end":3.740000009536743},{"word":"a","start":3.740000009536743,"end":4.260000228881836},{"word":"church","start":4.260000228881836,"end":4.260000228881836},{"word":"a","start":4.960000038146973,"end":4.980000019073486},{"word":"palace","start":4.980000019073486,"end":4.980000019073486},{"word":"or","start":5.079999923706055,"end":5.340000152587891},{"word":"a","start":5.340000152587891,"end":5.800000190734863},{"word":"fortress","start":5.800000190734863,"end":5.800000190734863},{"word":"I